invalid type: string "Widow Pension - Uttar Pradesh (UP-WIDOW) — faq\n\n**Q: What is this \"Widow Pension\" Scheme?**\n\nA: Widow pension in Uttar Pradesh is a social welfare scheme by the Government of Uttar Pradesh to provide financial assistance to widows residing in the state. The scheme is administered by the Women Welfare Department of the state government.\n\n**Q: What are the benefits?**